{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"日本東京男子持刀傷人　一名女子被刺身亡\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/JP-STAB-261116-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】日本東京發生持刀傷人事件，一名女子被刺身亡，疑犯被捕。</p><p>警員封鎖現場調查。事發在晚上約7時半，一名廿多歲的女子，在中野區街頭被一名男子持刀襲擊。據報女子頸部等處被刀刺傷，送院時昏迷，其後證實死亡。</p><p>警方拘捕一名約三、四十歲的男疑犯，仍在調查犯案動機。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:28.965973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:27:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T19:36:13.768570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:53:03.322444+00:00","content_hash":"495a2a2d766b40108ae993bc09bd67c3dd980c93a745c4a3b8ad0d330157ff8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}